      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-o/q7-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"1 −0.08 −0.72 −0.18 = 0.02. [B1] Hence P(S) = 0.18 + 0.02 = 0.20 . [A1] = P(S | H) As a second check the joint probability is 0.18 and the product of the marginals is (0.72 + 0.18)(0.20) = 0.18. The events are independent: [B1]\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
      "<p class=\"madas-total\">Total mark for question 7 is 9 marks.</p>"
